  "line_boundaries_note": "Boundaries use waveform silence inspection, not raw API normalized alignment. Placement shifts each line into its visual beat while preserving duration and order.",
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "Potter, don't turn around. Take my hand and move.",
      "source_start": 0.0,
      "source_end": 4.27
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "The floor marks anyone who stops. Keep dancing.",
      "source_start": 5.04,
      "source_end": 8.58
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "speaker": "HARRY",
      "text": "Tell me you're not serious.",
      "source_start": 9.22,
      "source_end": 10.63
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "speaker": "HARRY",
      "text": "That reflection is copying us.",
      "source_start": 11.05,
      "source_end": 13.03
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "speaker": "HARRY",
      "text": "The arrows land after the second beat.",
      "source_start": 13.63,
      "source_end": 16.55
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "Then move on the beat, not after it.",
      "source_start": 17.14,
      "source_end": 19.42
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "speaker": "HARRY",
      "text": "You knew what this was.",
      "source_start": 19.96,
      "source_end": 21.83
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "It's a Malfoy ward mark. I thought it was dead.",
      "source_start": 22.39,
      "source_end": 25.55
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "The music is carrying the curse. Cut those strings.",
      "source_start": 26.34,
      "source_end": 29.91
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "The suits of armor are moving. We need that trolley.",
      "source_start": 30.58,
      "source_end": 33.45
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "The floor is pulling us into the pattern.",
      "source_start": 34.05,
      "source_end": 36.17
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "speaker": "HARRY",
      "text": "Then we break it. Left side, three beats, red table.",
      "source_start": 36.77,
      "source_end": 40.9
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "They've marked us both.",
      "source_start": 41.38,
      "source_end": 42.61
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "speaker": "HARRY",
      "text": "You knew more than you said.",
      "source_start": 43.25,
      "source_end": 45.01
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "speaker": "DRACONIA",
      "text": "I sent you a warning. Someone made sure it never reached you.",
      "source_start": 45.5,
      "source_end": 49.4
    }
  ],
